# Committed generated replay sources are byte-compared against a fresh
# regeneration by their fixtures' tests, so checkout must hand back the exact
# committed bytes: a core.autocrlf=true checkout that rewrites their LF line
# endings to CRLF fails all four byte-for-byte suites on an otherwise clean
# tree (seen on a fresh Windows worktree, 2026-07-30).
tools/studio/generated-*.ts -text
